{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Saint☆Onii-san","Jesus Christ and Gautama Buddha, the founders of Christianity and Buddhism, are living together as roommates in a Tokyo apartment while taking a vacation on Earth. The comedy often involves jokes about Christianity, Buddhism, and all things related, as well as the main characters' attempts to hide their identities and understand modern society in Japan."],"ja":["聖☆おにいさん",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-15775","ids":{"shikimori":15775,"mal":15775,"anilist":15775,"kodik":"serial-40182"},"kodikIds":["serial-7565","serial-22394","serial-40182"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-7565":"2019-12-02T12:41:13Z","serial-22394":"2020-02-04T20:52:57Z","serial-40182":"2022-01-14T15:20:00Z"},"title":"Пресвятые отроки","originalTitle":"Saint Onii-san OVA","alt":"Пресвятые отроки OVA / Saint Oniisan OVA 聖☆おにいさん","description":"Иисус Христос и Будда Шакьямуни , основоположники христианства и буддизма, проводят свой отпуск на Земле и снимают квартирку в городских джунглях Токио. Анекдотичная комедия о христианстве, буддизме и всём, что с этим связано. Главные герои, прикидываясь простыми обывателями, пытаются понять современное японское общество.","year":2012,"type":"OVA","genres":["сэйнэн","Комедия"],"rating":7.47,"popularity":20939,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/15775/914430b34405ac4909f69cacae01cfa9.jpeg","width":705,"height":1000},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/15775-NaOdXtyVhrcU.jpg","width":1280,"height":720}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-609","dubId":"609","label":"AniDUB","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-7565","translationId":"609","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/